      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LinkedIn lead \u2192 Airtable\n\nPOST a flattened lead, or a LinkedIn lead-notification that only contains leadGenFormResponse. The second shape is fetched with the LinkedIn header credential, then the first email-like answer is used.\n\nAirtable is checked by the Email field before a row is created.",
